cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or its data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "AI Platform Capability Model"
abstract: >-
  A product-neutral capability model of AI agent platforms in three tiers:
  8 capability areas, 25 capabilities, and 127 services. Each service is one
  functional pattern on one asset, with a five-section architectural profile
  and evidence of which of nine platforms exhibit it.
authors:
